<sect1 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md21_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md21">
<title>Scope</title><para>This chapter covers <computeroutput>RegistryServer</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>RegistryClient</computeroutput> APIs and staged HTTP features. Start with local, scriptable behavior before distributed deployment polish. <computeroutput>RegistryStatus</computeroutput> values should describe not-found and I/O failures clearly.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre::RegistryServer<sp/>server;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre::RegistryClient<sp/>client;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::vector&lt;std::string&gt;<sp/>packages;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>st<sp/>=<sp/>server.list_packages(registry_root,<sp/>packages);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<sect3 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md22">
<title>Quick recap</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Keep this section aligned with Stage 6 local-first registry and HTTP endpoints.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Prefer explicit statuses and deterministic behavior.</para>
