<sect1 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md25_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md25">
<title>Client operations</title><para><computeroutput>deploy_http</computeroutput> uploads a bundle to registry. <computeroutput>download_http</computeroutput> pulls package bundle by name. <computeroutput>list_http</computeroutput> fetches package list for inspection and automation.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>publish<sp/>./demo.satpkg<sp/>--url<sp/>http://127.0.0.1:8080</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>fetch<sp/>demo-solver<sp/>--url<sp/>http://127.0.0.1:8080</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
