<sect1 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md29_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter10_1autotoc_md29">
<title>Health and listing</title><para>Provide a health endpoint to verify the registry is alive. Ensure package listings are deterministic so scripting is easy. Use small JSON payloads that are easy to inspect and test.</para>
